1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,580
The k th odd number is two k minus one.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:08,072
Split with the sigma rules: twice the sum of k, minus n.

3
00:00:08,072 --> 00:00:09,661
That is n squared.

4
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:14,830
One plus three plus five plus seven is sixteen, four squared.

5
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:15,664
Check.

